    "rootCause": [
      "The later mobile rule .asa h2 has the same specificity as .asa-course-module__identity h2 and overrides the intended 22px card-title size with clamp(2rem, 10vw, 3.1rem).",
      "The one-column course grid uses 1fr with its default automatic minimum, while the module card and identity text track do not establish min-width:0/minmax(0,1fr), so heading min-content width expands the complete card beyond the viewport.",
      "body overflow-x:hidden and .asa overflow-x:clip conceal the overflowing geometry, which makes right borders and content appear shifted instead of exposing a horizontal scrollbar."
    ],
    "isolatingExperimentsAt390CssPx": [
